l_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109146#issuecomment-3488338716","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109146","id":3488338716,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7P69Mc","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-04T23:14:44Z","updated_at":"2025-11-05T00:02:07Z","body":"This is printed on CI:\r\n\r\n```\r\nERROR: Export .NET Project: This project contains C# files but no solution file was found at the following path: /home/runner/work/godot/godot/misc/test_project/TestProject.sln\r\nA solution file is required for projects with C# files. Please ensure that the solution file exists in the specified location and try again.\r\n```\r\n\r\nHowever, the file exists at the specified path:\r\n\r\n```\r\nmisc/test_project/TestProject.sln: Unicode text, UTF-8 (with BOM) text\r\n```\r\n\r\nAdditionally, the GDExtension can't be found once the project is exported, even though it works when running the project files directly:\r\n\r\n```\r\n> Run xvfb-run ./bin/godot.linuxbsd.editor.x86_64.mono --main-pack /tmp/test_project.pck --audio-driver Dummy --resolution 64x64 --write-movie /tmp/test_project_pck.png --quit\r\nERROR: Condition \"!FileAccess::exists(path)\" is true. Returning: ERR_FILE_NOT_FOUND\r\n   at: open_dynamic_library (drivers/unix/os_unix.cpp:1057)\r\nERROR: GDExtension dynamic library not found: 'res://addons/test_extension/test_extension.gdextension'.\r\n   at: open_library (core/extension/gdextension.cpp:738)\r\nERROR: Error loading extension: 'res://addons/test_extension/test_extension.gdextension'.\r\n   at: load_extensions (core/extension/gdextension_manager.cpp:329)\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\nAlso, despite the many export/runtime errors, CI still passes. I currently can't use `check_ci_log.py` due to the leaked ObjectDB instances warning causing a CI failure, so I'd need to find another approach. Maybe I can add an argument to `check_ci_log.py` to ignore the leaked ObjectDB instances warning?\r\n\r\nFor context, the issue happens because [the project is quitting while audio is playing](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/76745). If you use a high enough value for `--quit-after` (e.g. `--quit-after 200`), it won't happen. \r\n\r\n**Edit:** I've increased the value for `--quit-after` (it used to be just `1`) and readded the call to `check_ci_log.py`, but it's still marking CI as passing even though there are errors. Any ideas?\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>Verbose log on exit</summary>\r\n\r\n```\r\nWARNING: ObjectDB instances leaked at exit (run with --verbose for details).\r\n     at: cleanup (core/object/object.cpp:2570)\r\nLeaked instance: AudioStreamPlaybackWAV:9223372083747096025 - Reference count: 1\r\nLeaked instance: AudioStreamPlaybackWAV:9223372083763873242 - Reference count: 1\r\nLeaked instance: AudioStreamPlaybackOggVorbis:9223372083713541605 - Reference count: 1\r\nLeaked instance: OggPacketSequencePlayback:9223372083730318822 - Reference count: 1\r\nLeaked instance: AudioStreamMP3:9223372078512604652 - Reference count: 1\r\nLeaked instance: OggPacketSequence:9223372078646822408 - Reference count: 3\r\nLeaked instance: AudioStreamOggVorbis:9223372078663599625 - Reference count: 1\r\nLeaked instance: AudioStreamWAV:9223372078814594571 - Reference count: 1\r\nLeaked instance: AudioStreamWAV:9223372078948812301 - Reference count: 1\r\nLeaked instance: AudioStreamPlaybackMP3:9223372083696764468 - Reference count: 1\r\nHint: Leaked instances typically happen when nodes are removed from the scene tree (with `remove_child()`) but not freed (with `free()` or `queue_free()`).\r\nERROR: 5 resources still in use at exit.\r\n   at: clear (core/io/resource.cpp:796)\r\nResource still in use: res://sounds/jump.mp3 (AudioStreamMP3)\r\nResource still in use: res://sounds/jump.ogg::OggPacketSequence_8vfxe (OggPacketSequence)\r\nResource still in use: res://sounds/jump.ogg (AudioStreamOggVorbis)\r\nResource still in use: res://sounds/jump.wav (AudioStreamWAV)\r\nResource still in use: res://sounds/jump_qoa.wav (AudioStreamWAV)\r\nOrphan StringName: Mesh (static: 18, total: 20)\r\nOrphan StringName: Tween (static: 2, total: 4)\r\nOrphan StringName: Shader (static: 3, total: 5)\r\nOrphan StringName: MainLoop (static: 3, total: 5)\r\nOrphan StringName: TriangleMesh (static: 2, total: 4)\r\nOrphan StringName: InputEvent (static: 18, total: 20)\r\nOrphan StringName: ExampleNode (static: 0, total: 2)\r\nOrphan StringName: ScriptBacktrace (static: 2, total: 4)\r\nOrphan StringName: Shape3D (static: 11, total: 13)\r\nOrphan StringName: ScriptLanguage (static: 3, total: 5)\r\nOrphan StringName: Font (static: 5, total: 7)\r\nOrphan StringName: Image (static: 2, total: 4)\r\nOrphan StringName: Resource (static: 418, total: 420)\r\nOrphan StringName: Viewport (static: 13, total: 15)\r\nOrphan StringName: MultiplayerAPI (static: 4, total: 6)\r\nOrphan StringName: DisplayServer (static: 2, total: 4)\r\nOrphan StringName: ConcavePolygonShape3D (static: 2, total: 4)\r\nOrphan StringName: CanvasItem (static: 128, total: 130)\r\nOrphan StringName: Master (static: 0, total: 8)\r\nOrphan