/api.github.com/users/JoNax97/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoNax97/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoNax97/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoNax97/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoNax97/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-12T15:55:52Z","updated_at":"2026-06-12T15:55:52Z","body":"Hi! Does this fully address the improvements described in the [priorities page? ](https://godotengine.org/priorities/#reliable-headless-command-line-export) or is more work to be done? \r\n\r\nThanks! ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4692883818/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4712197449","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109146#issuecomment-4712197449","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109146","id":4712197449,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGN5tSQ","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-15T20:33:42Z","updated_at":"2026-06-15T20:36:35Z","body":"> Hi! Does this fully address the improvements described in the [priorities page? ](https://godotengine.org/priorities/#reliable-headless-command-line-export)or is more work to be done?\r\n\r\nThere's still more work to be done, which is why I left that priority in when I updated the page:\r\n\r\n- https://github.com/godotengine/godot-website/pull/1238\r\n\r\nSome limitations (like the shader baker not working in headless builds) can't be fully addressed by design due to requiring GPU access, but perhaps we can document a workaround for them by running the editor with llvmpipe or SwiftShader (and keeping a X11/Wayland session active if on a server). Implementing [support for offscreen rendering](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/5790) will make the process a bit nicer (as no window would spawn when exporting a project in non-headless mode), but it's not strictly required.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4712197449/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]